@LocalHost = http://localhost:5038
@LiveHost = https://otel-store-api-b9f9gffrcmh5a0gk.southeastasia-01.azurewebsites.net

# Every request uses this host. Set it to {{LiveHost}} to target Azure.
@OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress = {{LocalHost}}

### Create a store. The response traceparent holds a .NET-generated trace id.
POST {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jakarta Pusat Flagship",
  "address": "Jl. M.H. Thamrin No. 1, Jakarta"
}

### Same request with our own traceparent. The response keeps its trace id.
# Format: version-traceId-parentSpanId-flags
POST {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores
Content-Type: application/json
traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01

{
  "name": "Bandung Outlet",
  "address": "Jl. Asia Afrika No. 8, Bandung"
}

### Read one store back. Replace the id with a returned one.
GET {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### List every store.
GET {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores
Accept: application/json

### Throw on purpose. Check the traceparent header matches the ProblemDetails traceId.
GET {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/boom
Accept: application/json

### Send no traceparent and read the one that comes back.
GET {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores
Accept: application/json

### Send a traceparent and compare. The trace id is unchanged; the span id differs.
GET {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores
Accept: application/json
traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01

### A resolvable address. The trace has a CLIENT span for the Nominatim call.
POST {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Brandenburg Gate Kiosk",
  "address": "Brandenburg Gate, Berlin"
}

### An unresolvable address. CreateStore should be Error with error.type and the address.
POST {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nowhere Outlet",
  "address": "qwertyuiop asdfghjkl zxcvbnm 12345"
}

### Missing fields. Returns 400 before any span work, so no failed span appears.
POST {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Send a traceparent and check the client span shares its trace id.
POST {{OpenTelemetry.Api_HostAddress}}/stores
Content-Type: application/json
traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01

{
  "name": "Traced Store",
  "address": "Eiffel Tower, Paris"
}

###
